{
  "info": {
    "name": "ResearchFlow Phase 5 - Selection and Access",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Run 01–17 manually using your existing leader, published project, two-member group and open supervisor opportunity. Variables are separate from earlier collections. Do not repeat a completed confirmation; read history or deliberately end it in the optional demonstration before starting again. The coordinator password is intentionally blank: set it locally for that optional folder. Permission checks return allowed:true/false; actual protected files are the next stage. Opening/accepting supervision does not approve a proposal. Sample passwords are fake values, no tokens are stored."
  },
